# Upstream's tree checks out as LF and stays that way. This is not cosmetic:
# `utils/ts-bookkeeping/build/` parses the `.tt` templates and
# `utils/tsproto-structs/declarations/*.csv` with `csv`/`toml` at build time, and
# a CRLF checkout puts `\r` into every field — a Windows-only build failure that
# looks like a parser bug. The root .gitattributes' `* text=auto` would do that
# whenever `core.autocrlf` is on, so it is overridden here.
* text eol=lf

